    <div class="content-card">
      <h1 class="post-title">Hi, I'm Rekha (<i>ray-ka</i>)</h1>
      <div class="post-content">
I've been on a spiritual path since I was a little girl. It's been a windy road that has led me down some of the darker corridors of the human experience; years of running away from my problems, anxiety, panic attacks, and sneaky spiritual bypassing.
<p>
The central theme in my journey has been to surrender to the wisdom of my experience. I now do my best to walk the middle path between the spiritual and the scientific, between faith and embodied presence.
<p>
I offer spiritual guidance through readings and workshops on topics like energy work, divination, somatic healing, and nervous system regulation. If you're local, you can find me in person at Vision Quest Bookstore in Everett, Washington.
<p>
This website is home to Rekha's Reflections, where I think out loud. It's a space for the thoughts that come to me on walks, in dreams, in the in-between moments of daily life when realizations pop up. I write about spirituality, healing, the middle path, and what it actually looks like to live a grounded, soul-led life. It's important to me to be honest even if it lacks clarity. This is not some Instagram-curated corner of the internet, but a raw and real one, with good days and hard days and long stretches of ordinary days that come with mundane living.
<p>
If you resonate with something here, I'd love to hear about it. My inbox is always open.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>